          the import engine DOES resolve them: the demo users, the demo
          group and the three sys_user_has_role rows all arrived on the
          instance carrying these artifacts' own sys_ids with correctly
          resolved user/role references. These therefore commit LINKED and
          need no post-commit repair; seed_demo_data.js only fills a
          reference it finds empty, so it is a no-op for them:
            assigned_group -> sys_user_group by name
            assigned_agent -> sys_user by user_name

        Adoption key: the pinned <number> CASE9000010 below. It sits in the
